          {"param": "rounding", "low": null, "high": null, "choices": ["round"]}
        ],
        "budget_share": 20,
        "why": "Control group: pipelined is feasible but currently higher area; check whether a different accuracy/throughput trade-off can beat pipelined_m."
      }
    ],
    "rationale": "Focus 80% of the next 100 evaluations on pipelined_m around the known feasible region, with a 20% control group on pipelined. Keep rounding=round, which is expected to help accuracy. The ranges are narrowed from the observed feasible ranges to spend budget where the Pareto front is likely to improve."
  }
}

